<title>UK: B.A.T. declares 11.36 pct stake in Stanley Leisure. [Corrected 17:50 gmt]</title>
<headline>B.A.T. declares 11.36 pct stake in Stanley Leisure. [Corrected 17:50 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tobacco-to-insurance group B.A.T Industries has declared an 11.36 percent stake in Stanley Leisure, Stanley said in a statement on Monday.  </p>
<p>(Corrects to show B.A.T. has declared, not sold its interest.)</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
